Captured `nexusd validate-config` stderr, replayed by the shell stand-in for
the rollback binary in TestTCSMERR36 (WI 4.3).

unknown-key.stderr is the real stderr of the real binary, captured at
fd1c443 with:

    go build -o /tmp/nexusd ./cmd/nexusd
    cd internal/providers/nexusd/testdata/validate-config
    /tmp/nexusd validate-config --config unknown-key.yaml 2>unknown-key.stderr

It exits 1 and prints one problem per line (cmd/nexusd validateConfig), here
two: the unknown top-level key and the misspelled providers.nexusd key.
Recapture it the same way if the message format changes.
